{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30562","headline":"竞渡诗 · 卢肇","name":"竞渡诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石溪久住思端午，馆驿楼前看发机。\n鼙鼓动时雷隐隐，兽头凌处雪微微。\n冲波突出入齐[譀]，跃浪争先鸟退飞。\n向道是龙刚不信，果然夺得锦标归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}